# Claude Code development tooling — never commit to git
CLAUDE.md
.claude/

# Helm packaged chart archives — use OCI registry or chart museum, not git
*.tgz

# Side-products of `helm template ... | split` workflows that drop one file
# per Kubernetes kind into the chart root (Deployment.yml, ConfigMap.yml, …).
# The repo itself uses .yaml everywhere, so a blanket .yml pattern at the
# chart root is safe.
/*.yml

# Helm dependency downloads — reproduce with `helm dependency update`
# Uncomment if you use chart dependencies (Chart.yaml dependencies[]):
# charts/*.tgz

# Local values overrides with secrets — never commit
*.local.yaml
*.secret.yaml
secrets.yaml
secret.yaml

# OS artifacts
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editor temp files
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.orig
.idea/
